#sortorder:3
#showas:虫族战争
A dangerous and deadly galaxy, this been taken over by three different groups of Intensity 8 Macrophage. Intended for someone who has spent a good amount of time in AI War 2.

This is on the 'simple' map type, with 80 planets. The Bar Fighter AI Type will do its best to fight off both you and the encroaching Macrophage threat.

The Macrophage are hostile to each other, and all come with their own quirks.

The Red Macrophage will never expand, but are always angry. They will produce harvesters faster than the others, and will never attempt to expand beyond their home planet.

The Blue Macrophage have spawnt in clusters of 2 Telia per planet, and will have a much easier time expanding rapidly.

The Green Macrophage have no inherit bonuses, but their more spread out nature will result in them poking their noses into more fights than the others.

Move fast, Tame some friendly Telium quickly, and expand your influence. The bugs are here, and they're hungry.